14778 1080 "I only" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414778 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414778 1083 #uuid "fe95e432-23b7-59d4-a759-3918bb1469c0" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414759 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414762 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414764 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414766 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414768 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1077 "selection" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1078 #edb/ref 17592186414766 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414779 1079 #uuid "07d2442a-7c11-598e-bd53-633db4a8551d" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414765 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414770 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414772 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414773 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414778 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1077 "selection" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1078 #edb/ref 17592186414778 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414780 1079 #uuid "5e2527fd-1520-5814-b1fe-d6567b06be4b" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414761 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414763 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414769 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414774 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414776 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1077 "selection" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1078 #edb/ref 17592186414774 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414781 1079 #uuid "67e57e20-93cb-5386-9ed7-6c9b4b0bdca5" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414760 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414767 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414771 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414775 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414777 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1077 "selection" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1078 #edb/ref 17592186414760 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414782 1079 #uuid "ff707b18-5e56-5002-82ef-862a25939ae5" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414781 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1069 "q-150012" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1071 "![](images/5a/5a3961346a4bcb0d94e46caf6d6ed1253dc56fb4761db07b11829e329bc2fa8d.png)\n\nConsider the part of parabola and constant vector field $F$ shown above. Let $C$ be the path where the part of parabola is traversed from $A$ to $B.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0$\n- ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1072 #uuid "0b65bfe0-6178-564e-825d-19d4ac9443d8" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414783 1074 "Remember that ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ gives the total work done by a force $F$ in moving a particle along $C:$\n\n- If the force works *with* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- If the force works *against* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statements I is false, while statement II is true. As the particle moves from $A$ to $B,$ the force $F$ works against the particle for $x>0,$ while $F$  works with the particle for $x<0.$ \n\n![](images/af/af80eab6427f376084301c03715fd098cfe4a1c816dcd72d3e1129cfa35ff29d.png)\n\n \n\nBy symmetry, the contribution to ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ for $x<0$ is canceled out by the contribution for $x>0.$ So,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. If we reverse the orientation of $C,$ then the situation with regards to the work done by $F$ is similar to the previous case.\n\n![](images/a2/a26ca79400bf30aa891543d30a052a6e8ec071ccb48fcd8c418fe0a713dad212.png)\n\n \n\nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414780 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1069 "q-125499" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1071 "![](images/8f/8ffc97d4fc442503eb5b59e01f317cc7a77cf57d041e16807aa0645f962a5aeb.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y)$ shown above. Let $C$ be the path where the three-quarter circle is traversed from $A$ to $B.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1072 #uuid "277ca4a2-1c02-58e4-b62f-d0e1176e96df" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414784 1074 "Remember that ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ gives the total work done by a force $F$ in moving a particle along $C:$\n\n- If the force works *with* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- If the force works *against* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true while statement II is false. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ assists the motion of the particle as it moves from $A$ to $B.$\n\n![](images/c9/c9805268d9f4984983c3cc5e2200a0c22d804bc67076a3505ad35471693c037b.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- Statement III is false. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ works against the motion of the particle as it moves from $B$ to $A.$\n\n![](images/da/dafb4d468e7711a804a5141301a02331bb5c7900f018a8ecdb6fd382bc05b799.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414785 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414779 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414785 1069 "q-125488" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414785 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414785 1071 "![](images/f7/f712612e5cf628e2cf6f2aac5195bf98b620edee4cab1791829a4ade13bcee15.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F$ shown above, and let $C$ be the path along the segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ traversed from $A$ to $B.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$" 13194139534225 17592186045417 true] [17592186414785 1072